      "body": "Sagar Cements Limited (BSE:502090) agreed to acquire remaining 25% stake in Andhra Cements Limited (BSE:532141) for INR 1.2 billion on June 5, 2026. The consideration consists of common equity of Sagar Cements Limited at a ratio of 0.2959 per common equity of Andhra Cements Limited. As part of consideration, an undisclosed value is paid towards common equity of Andhra Cements Limited. Upon completion, Sagar Cements Limited will own 100% stake in Andhra Cements Limited.\r\n\r\nThe transaction received approval of merger agreement by target board and approval of offer by acquirer board. \r\n\r\nAnand Rathi Financial Services Limited acted as fairness opinion provider for Sagar Cements Limited.",
